{"_id":"6ab67944578054e5018f81c9","title":"K A I O D By Askeradaman (femboy_c00lkidd)","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c77d0f","gameId":0,"name":"Universal Script 📌","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/b03cc03ab2f4fda29ea473f988ed1eff07defba51c2c7190bfcac42764aa2687.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/0-1790343526937.png"},"slug":"universal","path":"/game/universal","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/b03cc03ab2f4fda29ea473f988ed1eff07defba51c2c7190bfcac42764aa2687.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/0-1790343526937.png"},"placeId":0},"slug":"Universal-Script-K-A-I-O-D-By-Askeradaman-(femboy_c00lkidd)-229729","verified":false,"key":false,"keyless":false,"views":6680,"executes":42790,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":true,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","indexUnlisted":false,"image":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/9d07f9ef0befa76f977aef256a30190aceb5b4a43ec3cd61eeab607b393f48fc.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/0-1790343526937.png","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/0-1790343526937.png"},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/9d07f9ef0befa76f977aef256a30190aceb5b4a43ec3cd61eeab607b393f48fc.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/0-1790343526937.png","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/0-1790343526937.png"},"likeCount":2,"dislikeCount":3,"createdAt":"2026-09-25T13:38:13.062Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-25T13:38:13.062Z","lastBump":"2026-09-25T13:38:13.062Z","script":"loadstring(game:HttpGet('https://gist.githubusercontent.com/getKAIOD/cadc065bc7c51948fbd351d26977e409/raw/kaiod.txt'))()","features":"KAIOD v4.0 — Ultimate Edition\n🔗 Web: getkaiod.github.io\n\n⚡ What is KAIOD?\nKAIOD is a modern glassmorphism UI Roblox script built for chaos. Kill players, drag them, launch them into the void — all with a clean, animated interface.\n\n📌 How To Use\nGet a tool from the shop first (any random item works).\n\nPaste the script and execute.\n\nType a player name or random into the target box.\n\nPick your action and have fun.\n\n🎯 Core Features\nKill — Can kill players. Select by name or random.\n\nTarget ESP — Highlights your target with a live distance tag.\n\nDual Sliders — Adjustable Speed (0.5x – 3.0x) and Power (1.0x – 5.0x) multipliers.\n\nPlayer Dropdown — Instantly pick from a list of players.\n\nPageDown keybind — Toggle the GUI anytime.\n\n💥 Action Menu\n🖐️ Drag — Left click to drag the target, [Q] to stop.\n\n❄️ Freeze — Locks the target in place. (Currently patched — doesn't work.)\n\n🚀 Launch — Sends the target flying upward.\n\n🌀 Spin — Spins the target around rapidly.\n\n🌍 Earthquake — Shakes the target across the map.\n\n🎲 Toss — Hurls the target to a random location.\n\n🕳️ Blackhole — Pulls the target toward you.\n\n⚡ Super Fling — Extreme fling. Bypasses anti-fling.\n\n⚰️ Bring — Teleports the target directly to you.\n\n🔨 Slam — Slams the target into the ground repeatedly.\n\n⚡ Electro Jitter — Violent random jittering.\n\n🕳️ Sinkhole Trap — Slowly sinks the target underground.\n\n💫 Orbit Shield — Orbits the target around your position.\n\n📍 Click TP — Press, then click anywhere on the map to teleport the target there.\n\n🌪️ Tornado — Spirals the target upward.\n\n🔀 Version Switch\nThe GUI has a Version Button in the header.\n\nBase version is v3.9 (Physics Mode).\n\nPress the v3.9 button → you switch to v4.0 (Touch + CFrame Mode).\n\nPress again to switch back.\n\nEach version uses a different movement/attack system — try both to see which works better for your game.\n\n⚠️ Notes\nFreeze is patched — don't bother.\n\nSuper Fling is designed to bypass anti-fling.\n\nIf you find a bug, please report it. Feedback helps improve the script.","tags":["K A I OD","Kaiod","kill script","askeradaman","roblox"],"discord":"","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"6a747cb597f7d53d5b5d6321","username":"femboy_c00lkidd","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/705d6af653b1ca5ca04ed6e386422f44ea671688707a803f